{"id":"centaine","lemma":"centaine","pos":"noun","rank":1604,"glosses":["a hundred or so, about a hundred","hundreds (in arithmetic)"],"ipa":"/sɑ̃.tɛn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ab/Fr-centaine.ogg/Fr-centaine.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"centaines"},"formAudio":{"centaines":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-centaines.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'ai lu des centaines de livres.","en":"I've read hundreds of books.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to read","l":"lire"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"book","l":"livre"}]},{"text":"Une centaine d'années est appelée un siècle.","en":"A hundred years is called a century.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"year","l":"année"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"century"}]},{"text":"Il y avait là plusieurs centaines de personnes.","en":"There were hundreds of people there.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"several, many, a lot"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"no one, nobody","l":"personne"}]},{"text":"Des centaines d'animaux ont été tués.","en":"Hundreds of animals were killed.","words":[{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"animal","l":"animal"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},null]},{"text":"Plus d'une centaine de personnes est venue ici.","en":"Over one hundred people came here.","words":[{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"no one, nobody","l":"personne"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"coming, arrival"},{"g":"here"}]}]}